 {
  "sheet": "sheets/c3-0088_p1_s1.jpg",
  "cards": [
   {
    "k": 1,
    "id": "c3-0088:3",
    "text": "Supervisor Rollings offered the following resolution:"
   },
   {
    "k": 2,
    "id": "c3-0088:4",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Minnesota statues 103F.48 requires SWCDs in consultation with local water management authorities, to develop, adopt, and submit to each local water management authority within its boundary a summary of \u201cOther Watercourses\u201d for inclusion into the local water management plan; and"
   },
   {
    "k": 3,
    "id": "c3-0088:25",
    "text": "n"
   },
   {
    "k": 4,
    "id": "c3-0088:5",
    "text": "WHEREAS, The Board of Water and Soil Resources has adopted the Local Water Resources Riparian Protection \u201cOther Watercourses\u201d Policy August 25, 2016 which identifies steps SWCDs are required to take in developing said inventory; and"
   },
   {
    "k": 5,
    "id": "c3-0088:6",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Blue Earth SWCD met with local water management authorities within its jurisdiction; and"
   },
   {
    "k": 6,
    "id": "c3-0088:37",
    "text": "t"
   },
   {
    "k": 7,
    "id": "c3-0088:38",
    "text": "e"
   },
   {
    "k": 8,
    "id": "c3-0088:7",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Blue Earth SWCD considered watershed data, water quality and land use information; and"
   },
   {
    "k": 9,
    "id": "c3-0088:8",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Blue Earth SWCD has assessed the water quality benefits that buffers or alternative practices could provide to local water resources that were not included on the Buffer Protection Map; and"
   },
   {
    "k": 10,
    "id": "c3-0088:114",
    "text": "t"
   },
   {
    "k": 11,
    "id": "c3-0088:115",
    "text": "e"
   },
   {
    "k": 12,
    "id": "c3-0088:9",
    "text": "WHEREAS, Blue Earth SWCD determined that the rational for inclusion of \u201cOther Watercourses\u201d is once water is moving in a buffered channel, it is most beneficial if that water stayed in a buffered channel."
   }
  ]
 },
 {
  "sheet": "sheets/c3-0088_p1_s2.jpg",
  "cards": [
   {
    "k": 1,
    "id": "c3-0088:10",
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED that the Blue Earth SWCD approves the summary of \u201cOther Watercourses\u201d in map format for Blue Earth County in accordance with Minnesota Statute 103F.48 for inclusion into the Local Water Management Plan."
   },
   {
    "k": 2,
    "id": "c3-0088:11",
    "text": "Supervisor Krosch seconded the adoption of the following resolution, and it was declared adopted upon the following vote, June 8, 2017:"
   },
   {
    "k": 3,
    "id": "c3-0088:117",
    "text": "e"
   },
   {
    "k": 4,
    "id": "c3-0088:12",
    "text": "Ayes: 5 Nays: 0"
   }
  ]
 },
